# 🕵️ Investigations — Receipts Over Rhetoric

This folder hosts evidence-based reports designed to remove plausible deniability.

Principles:

- Receipts > rhetoric. Every claim gets a primary source.
- Methodology > moralizing. We let the pattern speak for itself.
- NPR-style integrity. Separate reporting from analysis; mark opinions clearly.

Start here:

- `PLAUSIBLE_DENIABILITY_SMASHER.md` — Manifesto + method + publication workflow
- `TIMELINE_AI_SAFETY_2024_2026.md` — Chronology of public claims vs. shipped reality
- `RECEIPTS_INDEX.md` — Central list of sources (URLs, filings, transcripts)

Release rule: No public release until all [VERIFY] markers are resolved and all claims are sourced.
